                    color: AdnColors.white,
                    fontSize: 12,
                    fontWeight: FontWeight.w700,
                  ),
                ),
                const SizedBox(height: 7),
                const Text(
                  'Sin conectar',
                  style: TextStyle(color: AdnColors.muted, fontSize: 12),
                ),
              ],
            ),
          ),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }
}

// ============================================================
// FORMULARIO DE REGISTRO PRELIMINAR
// ============================================================

class CompanyFormDialog extends StatefulWidget {
  final VoidCallback onValidated;

  const CompanyFormDialog({super.key, required this.onValidated});

  @override
  State<CompanyFormDialog> createState() => _CompanyFormDialogState();
}

class _CompanyFormDialogState extends State<CompanyFormDialog> {
  final GlobalKey<FormState> _formKey = GlobalKey<FormState>();

  final TextEditingController _businessName = TextEditingController();

  final TextEditingController _legalName = TextEditingController();

  final TextEditingController _phone = TextEditingController();

  final TextEditingController _businessEmail = TextEditingController();

  final TextEditingController _country = TextEditingController(
    text: 'Honduras',
  );

  final TextEditingController _city = TextEditingController();

  final TextEditingController _adminName = TextEditingController();

  final TextEditingController _adminEmail = TextEditingController();

  String _selectedPlan = 'BÃ¡sico';

  @override
  void dispose() {
    _businessName.dispose();
    _legalName.dispose();
    _phone.dispose();
    _businessEmail.dispose();
    _country.dispose();
    _city.dispose();
    _adminName.dispose();
    _adminEmail.dispose();

    super.dispose();
  }

  // ==========================================================
  // VALIDACIONES
  // ==========================================================

  String? _requiredValidator(String? value) {
    if (value == null || value.trim().isEmpty) {
      return 'Este campo es obligatorio.';
    }

    return null;
  }

  String? _emailValidator(String? value) {
    final String text = value?.trim() ?? '';

    if (text.isEmpty) {
      return 'El correo es obligatorio.';
    }

    final bool isValid = RegExp(r'^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$').hasMatch(text);

    if (!isValid) {
      return 'Ingresa un correo electrÃ³nico vÃ¡lido.';
    }

    return null;
  }

  String? _optionalEmailValidator(String? value) {
    final String text = value?.trim() ?? '';

    if (text.isEmpty) {
      return null;
    }

    return RegExp(r'^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$').hasMatch(text)
        ? null
        : 'Ingresa un correo electrÃ³nico vÃ¡lido.';
  }

  String? _phoneValidator(String? value) {
    final String text = value?.trim() ?? '';

    if (text.isEmpty) {
      return 'El telÃ©fono es obligatorio.';
    }

    final String digits = text.replaceAll(RegExp(r'\D'), '');

    if (digits.length < 8) {
      return 'Ingresa un nÃºmero de telÃ©fono vÃ¡lido.';
    }

    return null;
  }

  // ==========================================================
  // DISEÃ‘O DE LOS CAMPOS
  // ==========================================================

  InputDecoration _decoration(String label, IconData icon) {
    return InputDecoration(
      labelText: label,
      labelStyle: const TextStyle(color: AdnColors.muted, fontSize: 13),
      prefixIcon: Icon(icon, color: AdnColors.muted, size: 20),
      filled: true,
      fillColor: AdnColors.background,
      contentPadding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 15, vertical: 17),
      enabledBorder: OutlineInputBorder(
        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12),
        borderSide: const BorderSide(color: AdnColors.border),
      ),
      focusedBorder: OutlineInputBorder(
        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12),
        borderSide: const BorderSide(color: AdnColors.turquoise, width: 1.4),
      ),
      errorBorder: OutlineInputBorder(
        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12),
        borderSide: const BorderSide(color: AdnColors.coral),
      ),
      focusedErrorBorder: OutlineInputBorder(
        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12),
        borderSide: const BorderSide(color: AdnColors.coral, width: 1.4),
      ),
    );
  }

  Widget _input({
    required TextEditingController controller,
    required String label,
    required IconData icon,
    String? Function(String?)? validator,
    TextInputType keyboardType = TextInputType.text,
  }) {
    return TextFormField(
      controller: controller,
      keyboardType: keyboardType,
      style: const TextStyle(color: AdnColors.white, fontSize: 13),
      decoration: _decoration(label, icon),
      validator: validator,
      autovalidateMode: AutovalidateMode.onUserInteraction,
    );
  }

  Widget _sectionTitle(String title) {
    return Padding(
      padding: const EdgeInsets.only(top: 9, bottom: 17),
      child: Text(
        title,
        style: const TextStyle(
          color: AdnColors.white,
          fontSize: 17,
          fontWeight: FontWeight.w800,
        ),
      ),
    );
  }

  // ==========================================================
  // VALIDAR FORMULARIO
  // ==========================================================

  void _validateForm() {
    if (_formKey.currentState?.validate() != true) {
      return;
    }

    widget.onValidated();
  }

  // ==========================================================
  // INTERFAZ
  // ==========================================================

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    final bool isMobile = MediaQuery.sizeOf(context).width < 620;

    return Dialog(
      backgroundColor: AdnColors.panel,
      insetPadding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 14, vertical: 18),
      shape: RoundedRectangleBorder(
        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(20),
        side: const BorderSide(color: AdnColors.border),
      ),
      child: SizedBox(
        width: 700,
        height: MediaQuery.sizeOf(context).height * 0.86,
        child: Padding(
          padding: EdgeInsets.all(isMobile ? 16 : 24),
          child: Column(
            children: [
              // ENCABEZADO
              Row(
                children: [
                  Container(
                    width: 45,
                    height: 45,
                    decoration: BoxDecoration(
                      color: AdnColors.turquoise.withValues(alpha: 0.10),
                      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12),
                    ),
                    child: const Icon(
                      Icons.add_business_rounded,
                      color: AdnColors.turquoiseLight,
                    ),
                  ),

                  const SizedBox(width: 13),

                  const Expanded(
                    child: Column(
                      crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
                      children: [
                        Text(
                          'Nueva empresa',
                          style: TextStyle(
                            color: AdnColors.white,
                            fontSize: 19,
                            fontWeight: FontWeight.w800,
                          ),
                        ),
                        SizedBox(height: 4),
                        Text(
                          'Registro inicial del autolavado',
                          style: TextStyle(
                            color: AdnColors.muted,
                            fontSize: 12,
                          ),
                        ),
                      ],
                    ),
                  ),

                  IconButton(
                    tooltip: 'Cerrar',
                    onPressed: () {
                      Navigator.of(context).pop();
                    },
                    icon: const Icon(
                      Icons.close_rounded,
                      color: AdnColors.muted,
                    ),
                  ),
                ],
              ),

              const SizedBox(height: 18),

              const Divider(height: 1, color: AdnColors.border),

              // CONTENIDO DESPLAZABLE
              Expanded(
                child: Form(
                  key: _formKey,
                  child: SingleChildScrollView(
                    padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 16),
                    child: Column(
                      crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
                      children: [
                        _sectionTitle('Datos del negocio'),

                        _input(
                          controller: _businessName,
                          label: 'Nombre comercial *',
                          icon: Icons.storefront_rounded,
                          validator: _requiredValidator,
                        ),

                        const SizedBox(height: 15),

                        _input(
                          controller: _legalName,
                          label: 'RazÃ³n social',
                          icon: Icons.business_rounded,
                        ),

                        const SizedBox(height: 15),

                        _input(
                          controller: _phone,
                          label: 'TelÃ©fono *',
                          icon: Icons.phone_rounded,
                          keyboardType: TextInputType.phone,
                          validator: _phoneValidator,
                        ),

                        const SizedBox(height: 15),

                        _input(
                          controller: _businessEmail,
                          label: 'Correo comercial',
                          icon: Icons.alternate_email_rounded,
                          keyboardType: TextInputType.emailAddress,
                          validator: _optionalEmailValidator,
                        ),

                        const SizedBox(height: 15),

                        _input(
                          controller: _country,
                          label: 'PaÃ­s *',
                          icon: Icons.public_rounded,
                          validator: _requiredValidator,
                        ),

                        const SizedBox(height: 15),

                        _input(
                          controller: _city,
                          label: 'Ciudad',
                          icon: Icons.location_city_rounded,
                        ),

                        const SizedBox(height: 21),

                        const Divider(color: AdnColors.border),

                        _sectionTitle('Administrador principal'),

                        _input(
                          controller: _adminName,
                          label: 'Nombre del administrador *',
                          icon: Icons.person_rounded,
                          validator: _requiredValidator,
                        ),

                        const SizedBox(height: 15),

                        _input(
                          controller: _adminEmail,
                          label: 'Correo del administrador *',
                          icon: Icons.mail_outline_rounded,
                          keyboardType: TextInputType.emailAddress,
                          validator: _emailValidator,
                        ),

                        const SizedBox(height: 18),

                        const Text(
                          'Las credenciales temporales '
                          'se generarÃ¡n de forma segura '
                          'cuando implementemos el servidor.',
                          style: TextStyle(
                            color: AdnColors.muted,
                            fontSize: 12,
                            height: 1.6,
                          ),
                        ),

                        const SizedBox(height: 22),

                        const Divider(color: AdnColors.border),

                        _sectionTitle('Plan de suscripciÃ³n'),

                        DropdownButtonFormField<String>(
                          initialValue: _selectedPlan,
                          dropdownColor: AdnColors.panel,
                          decoration: _decoration(
                            'Plan inicial',
                            Icons.workspace_premium_rounded,
                          ),
                          items: const [
                            DropdownMenuItem(
                              value: 'BÃ¡sico',
                              child: Text('BÃ¡sico'),
                            ),
                            DropdownMenuItem(
                              value: 'Intermedio',
                              child: Text('Intermedio'),
                            ),
                            DropdownMenuItem(value: 'Pro', child: Text('Pro')),
                          ],
                          onChanged: (value) {
                            if (value != null) {
                              setState(() {
                                _selectedPlan = value;
                              });
                            }
                          },
                        ),

                        const SizedBox(height: 20),

                        Container(
                          width: double.infinity,
                          padding: const EdgeInsets.all(14),
                          decoration: BoxDecoration(
                            color: AdnColors.turquoise.withValues(alpha: 0.06),
                            borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12),
                            border: Border.all(
                              color: AdnColors.turquoise.withValues(
                                alpha: 0.18,
                              ),
                            ),
                          ),
                          child: const Text(
                            'Esta pantalla permite revisar '
                            'y validar los datos. '
                            'TodavÃ­a no crea una empresa '
                            'ni guarda informaciÃ³n.',
                            style: TextStyle(
                              color: AdnColors.white,
                              fontSize: 12,
                              height: 1.6,
                            ),
                          ),
                        ),
                      ],
                    ),
                  ),
                ),
              ),

              const Divider(height: 1, color: AdnColors.border),

              const SizedBox(height: 16),

              // ACCIONES
              Row(
                children: [
                  Expanded(
                    child: OutlinedButton(
                      onPressed: () {
                        Navigator.of(context).pop();
                      },
                      style: OutlinedButton.styleFrom(
                        foregroundColor: AdnColors.white,
                        padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 16),
                        side: const BorderSide(color: AdnColors.border),
                      ),
                      child: const Text('Cancelar'),
                    ),
                  ),

                  const SizedBox(width: 12),

                  Expanded(
                    child: FilledButton(
                      onPressed: _validateForm,
                      style: FilledButton.styleFrom(
                        backgroundColor: AdnColors.turquoise,
                        foregroundColor: Colors.white,
                        padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 16),
                      ),
                      child: const Text(
                        'Validar datos',
                        style: TextStyle(fontWeight: FontWeight.w800),
                      ),
                    ),
                  ),
                ],
              ),
            ],
          ),
        ),
      ),
    );
  }
}
